-------\n   135→        \\\\  tri geom sphere distance <coords>   Great circle distance (haversine)\n   136→        \\\\  tri geom sphere triangle <A> <B> <C> Spherical triangle (angle excess)\n   137→        \\\\  tri geom hyper triangle <A> <B> <C>  Hyperbolic triangle (angle defect)\n   138→        \\\\  tri geom curvature                  K = {{-1, 0, +1}} = ternary!\n   139→        \\\\\n   140→        \\\\  tri geom help                       This message\n   141→        \\\\\n   142→        \\\\  ALIASES: geo, geometry, fp (formula-predict), lattice-coptic\n   143→        \\\\\n   144→        \\\\  +====================================================================+\n   145→        \\\\\n   146→    , .{});\n   147→}\n   148→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"44d2ecaa-b17e-43c0-bdaa-9bdb8e6b7a9a","uuid":"f3913d35-c8b1-4441-b3a9-ce2836c9146c","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/playra/trinity-w1/src/tri/geometry/commands.zig","content":"// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n// SACRED GEOMETRY MODULE v1.0 — CLI COMMANDS\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n// Main command dispatcher for tri geom commands.\n// φ² + 1/φ² = 3 = TRINITY | Sierpinski dim = 1.585 = bits/trit\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nconst std = @import(\"std\");\nconst platonic = @import(\"platonic.zig\");\nconst fractal = @import(\"fractal.zig\");\nconst sacred = @import(\"sacred.zig\");\nconst computational = @import(\"computational.zig\");\nconst non_euclidean = @import(\